{"4286700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Still Winter", "steam_appid": 4286700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Still Winter</strong> is a <strong>Retro</strong> <strong>Dark Action-Adventure</strong> game <strong>with light RPG and survival elements</strong> about a retired adventurer whose story is not yet finished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt monsters, cook powerful meals from their remains, and descend into a mysterious dungeon to uncover the source of the spreading threat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a multi-leveled dungeon -</strong> uncover the source of the spreading  threat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in slow, methodical combat -</strong> inspired by classic first-person fantasy games where positioning, timing, and stamina matter more than speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt and fight monsters -</strong> harvest their parts to sell for coin or use in cooking</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook meals from monster parts -</strong> prepare recipes that grant temporary buffs and status effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help the remaining villagers -</strong> complete quests to earn unique rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> <strong>-</strong> carefully manage hunger, warmth and exhaustion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PS1-inspired retro aesthetic -</strong> pixelated graphics and optional filters for a classic console look</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Still Winter</strong> is a <strong>Retro</strong> <strong>Dark Action-Adventure</strong> game <strong>with light RPG and survival elements</strong> about a retired adventurer whose story is not yet finished.</p><p class=\"bb_p